@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #000000
skinparam ComponentFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam RectangleFontColor #000000

title MCP Architecture Before GitHub App Wrapper

actor "LLM / Agent" as Agent #E8F0FE
component "MCP Server\n(linear-management-mcp)" as Mcp #D9EAD3
rectangle "Linear Template Layer" as LinearTemplates #D0E0FF
component "Linear Wrapper\n(@linear/sdk)" as LinearWrapper #FFF4CC
component "Linear API" as LinearApi #FFE5E5
database "Linear Workspace" as LinearDb #EAF7EA

Agent --> Mcp : Linear tool calls
Mcp --> LinearTemplates : Validate/normalize markdown
Mcp --> LinearWrapper : Create/update issues
LinearWrapper --> LinearApi
LinearApi --> LinearDb

note bottom of Mcp #FFFDEB
No GitHub App integration.
No installation-aware GitHub operations.
end note

@enduml

